        "original_id": "9581a7dc-a81b-5fd9-b633-6450ef0b862f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert John Bardo, Rebecca Schaeffer\n- Crimes: stalking, murder, conviction, life imprisonment without parole\n\nFacts:\n- Rebecca Schaeffer was born on November 6, 1967, and she was an American model and actress.\n- Robert John Bardo was born on January 2, 1970, and he is an American man.\n- Robert John Bardo stalked Rebecca Schaeffer for three years before her death.\n- Robert John Bardo murdered Rebecca Schaeffer on July 18, 1989.\n- Rebecca Schaeffer died on July 18, 1989.\n- In October 1991, Robert John Bardo was convicted of the murder of Rebecca Schaeffer.\n- Robert John Bardo is serving life imprisonment without parole for murdering Rebecca Schaeffer.",
